[{"children":[{"text":"【导读】Anthropic估值即将冲破9000亿美元，OpenAI的用户正在用脚投票——两家公司的命运曲线，正在交叉。"}],"type":"p","id":"VlpK3J-W1z"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"AI界深水炸弹！"}],"id":"pq6UWg1-qL"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"4月29日，Anthropic被爆正在谈判新一轮融资，估值可能突破9000亿美元。"}],"id":"kx5M6lWVo0"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/d23512192b33.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"cpdaJnS5ls"}],"id":"rHFMrK6jtC"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"如果交割完成，这家成立不到四年的公司将一举超越OpenAI，成为地球上最贵的AI独角兽。"}],"id":"gM_MIRsaCS"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"9000亿美元。"}],"id":"7F_XKpg_r1"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"这个数字意味着什么？"}],"id":"-Fn-T6DCxr"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"放在A股，它比贵州茅台的市值还高。放在硅谷，它把OpenAI苦心经营了十年的估值王座，一脚踢翻。"}],"id":"E1NyyjdHIy"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"更耐人寻味的是时间线。就在几个月前，Anthropic的估值还是600亿美元。"}],"id":"nbZJ7pkDJq"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"谷歌和亚马逊先后以3500亿美元估值向其注资，合计承诺投入高达650亿美元。从600亿到9000亿，不到一年，"},{"text":"15倍","bold":true},{"text":"。"}],"id":"ehAp4x3Owj"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/466282894955.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"34oK1mQ2MT"}],"id":"ayklGq_BUP"},{"type":"p","align":"center","children":[{"text":"Claude生成的Anthropic估值时间线"}],"id":"s9MrApGzjY"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"资本不说谎。当全世界最精明的钱疯狂涌向同一个方向，一定有什么东西变了。"}],"id":"9QgHyYWYg0"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"变的是什么？"}],"id":"f2L5feae30"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"答案触目惊心——"}],"id":"89ieumbTbO"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"根据市场情报公司Sensor Tower的数据，ChatGPT今年4月的卸载量同比增加了132%。而在上个月，其卸载率甚至更高，同比上升了413%。","bold":true}],"id":"E1jCuHuygR"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/77663afeccc4.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"WlnyXtUS1g"}],"id":"xac5xG5LeX"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"ChatGPT的卸载量一度暴涨了"},{"text":"563%。同一时期，Claude的下载量一周激增199%","bold":true},{"text":"。"}],"id":"ySKMyS5BDY"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/3ae9d8553731.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"TFt9-NbYbq"}],"id":"icOJolx0G0"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"在多个国家，Claude一度登顶iPhone免费应用排行榜。"}],"id":"QGRusHoSr4"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/99990e8daac2.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"MMuM0a_h3k"}],"id":"lGV1Z93P3z"},{"type":"p","align":"center","children":[{"text":"Claude在美国的单日下载量首次超过了ChatGPT。2月28日，该应用冲上美国App Store免费应用榜首，并一直保持到3月2日，短短一周内排名跃升了20多位。Claude还在比利时、加拿大、德国、卢森堡、挪威和瑞士的iPhone免费应用排行榜上登顶"}],"id":"sSZI1sTg3q"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"用户在用脚投票。而且是踩着油门投的。"}],"id":"_PJ6Cc4wWc"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"OpenAI：帝国的裂缝从内部开始","bold":true}],"id":"ioH3AVsC4x"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"表面上看，OpenAI依然庞大。"}],"id":"SB2qcMqUWx"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"GPT系列坐拥数亿用户，Codex刚刚掀起新一轮热潮，星际之门项目号称要砸5000亿美元建算力基础设施。"}],"id":"wckzptdvQr"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"但帝国的裂缝，往往先从内部裂开。"}],"id":"6HQ-YBoXVJ"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"如果说用户流失是皮肤之痛，那么「星际之门」（Stargate）的缩水则是OpenAI的断骨之伤。"}],"id":"MCLlKiNhwl"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/b7e83d04ed65.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"iKBMiG9cb2"}],"id":"iRrQef54F2"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"据媒体调查，星际之门项目的实际进展远不如PPT上那么光鲜。"}],"id":"xEoFx209b2"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"5000亿美元。10座核电站。人类通往未来的唯一通道。 现在，它成了一张缩水的租房合同。"}],"id":"K9GGqz3gNH"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"英国的项目，停了。 挪威的项目，砍了。 德克萨斯州的旗舰基地，放弃了。"}],"id":"2fSSaX2sKL"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"奥特曼说这叫「灵活心态」。合作伙伴说这叫「过河拆桥」。软银在愤怒，甲骨文在算账，微软在废墟边默默捡漏。"}],"id":"T6cC5Ehh6Z"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"这幕后的潜台词再清楚不过：当 OpenAI开始推脱基建责任，它就失去了对物理世界的控制权。"}],"id":"T_G7TkBC-D"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"资金到位节奏、算力中心选址、合作方协调——每一个环节都在磨。"}],"id":"7AELWQlx1e"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"「进度比预期慢了很多。」"}],"id":"HLidQ7aSyV"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"http://localhost:7777/api/files/materials/2026-05/08e94c0cccae.jpg","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"oUgRXV4Qe4"}],"id":"dUTozey1__"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"与此同时，OpenAI正在经历一场静默的人才失血。"}],"id":"zZEN2U_gxm"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Dario Amodei——Anthropic的创始人兼CEO——本身就是OpenAI的前研究副总裁。"}],"id":"KwbcATzex2"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"他带走的不只是自己，还有一批OpenAI最核心的安全研究员。"}],"id":"dSweELjOJn"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"谈离开 OpenAI时，他直言：「与其留下来争论别人的愿景，不如带上你信任的人，去把自己的愿景做出来。」"}],"id":"oeuUkUmypF"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"这种出走从未停止。过去两年，OpenAI的对齐团队、安全团队持续有骨干流向Anthropic。"}],"id":"wMsDTvt8bS"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"一个公司最值钱的资产是什么？不是用户数，不是估值，是那群能定义下一代模型的人。"}],"id":"HZfGIgofn8"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"当这群人选择离开，方向本身就是答案。"}],"id":"WmwugZqgYl"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"Anthropic：从「安全实验室」到「最贵独角兽」","bold":true}],"id":"FJnwQcuasC"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Anthropic的崛起路径，和硅谷的常规叙事完全不同。"}],"id":"q8pCU8plxC"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"它不是靠烧钱抢用户起家的。"}],"id":"CEwX-7PUTr"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"它的起点是一篇关于AI安全的论文，它的卖点是「Constitutional AI」——用宪法约束模型行为。在很长一段时间里，硅谷主流的看法是：这帮人太理想主义了，做不大。"}],"id":"zy1_rkA2SG"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"然后，Claude 3.5 Sonnet发布了。"}],"id":"z13YvyrHi3"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"编程能力碾压GPT-4o，长上下文理解遥遥领先，幻觉率大幅降低。"}],"id":"RpOVyTNlnc"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260430/v2_db53c33a867e4386913bb097c77c1dd2@46958_oswg312391oswg1080oswg930_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"gbiC0IT1l2"}],"id":"Ak4bpef9Vi"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"开发者社区的风向一夜之间转了。Reddit、Hacker News、X上到处都是同一句话：「我把ChatGPT Plus退了，换Claude了。」"}],"id":"qyz2DpoLNN"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"不是一个人这么说，是成千上万人这么说。"}],"id":"sAoaOlK8av"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"更关键的是企业端。AWS上Claude的API调用量在过去半年翻了不止一番。"}],"id":"SrMd620f0h"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"越来越多的企业客户开始把核心业务从GPT迁移到Claude——不是因为便宜，是因为好用。"}],"id":"_2FCja6FGx"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260430/v2_2773734cd63f4da3bcf2e7afeae36dc5@46958_oswg710687oswg1080oswg1180_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"MOQ47Zu4H1"}],"id":"I-KljmWysB"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"谷歌看到了这一点，所以砸了钱。亚马逊看到了这一点，所以也砸了钱。两家巨头合计承诺650亿美元，赌的不是Anthropic的现在，是它定义下一代AI的能力。"}],"id":"wreEzhRoZL"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"但，OpenAI真的输了吗？","bold":true}],"id":"iHBD7VElml"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"先别急着给OpenAI写墓志铭。"}],"id":"7yIO3ljHJP"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"GPT-5系列的迭代速度依然惊人。5.5刚刚落地，后台日志里就冒出了5.6的影子。"}],"id":"Q9Zjnye91B"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260430/v2_2ab1e306d22144d7bc5b85e504ca5d78@46958_oswg393394oswg1080oswg590_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"mFaoFe3Oqk"}],"id":"KbsdtQtgtV"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Codex作为智能体工具正在全面起飞，开发者生态的护城河不是一朝一夕能攻破的。"}],"id":"0LCL8QZcvJ"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"OpenAI的另一张底牌是规模。数亿月活用户、与微软的深度绑定、遍布全球的企业客户——这些存量优势不会因为一轮融资新闻就蒸发。"}],"id":"h-ffHQfklL"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"历史上，估值超越从来不等于胜负已定。"}],"id":"bTpA7uwVAV"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"2012年Facebook上市时，很多人觉得谷歌的社交梦碎了。十年后再看，谷歌的搜索帝国从未真正被威胁。"}],"id":"Nv-2UBmThQ"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"AI竞赛的残酷之处在于：今天的王座，下一轮模型发布后可能就不作数了。","bold":true}],"id":"-QX7KJTAli"},{"type":"h2","children":[{"text":"风起青萍之末：大事正在发生","bold":true}],"id":"1fZj-GtLHC"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"把视角拉远，这不是一个「谁赢谁输」的故事。"}],"id":"GUAXKTJ0k4"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"这是一个「AI行业的权力结构正在被重写」的故事。"}],"id":"ykaKFAO0av"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"两年前，OpenAI是唯一的巨星。"}],"id":"1TC7AgxWsb"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"一年前，谷歌Gemini开始追赶。"}],"id":"Neuycs9NuJ"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"今天，Anthropic冲到了估值第一的位置。"}],"id":"vqo4cImSZT"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"与此同时，xAI在烧钱、Meta在搅局、开源AI在追赶。"}],"id":"B2ILS2Im-v"},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"img","url":"https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260430/v2_2f6371fd15cd45a782f184770ec1a034@46958_oswg2716549oswg1055oswg1491_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1","children":[{"text":""}],"id":"RXlRUbW8sh"}],"id":"f6oxxszhAh"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"赢家不再只有一个。AI正在从「一超独霸」走向「群雄割据」。"}],"id":"xzSvS0tESn"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"而在这场混战中，真正决定胜负的变量只有一个——"},{"text":"谁能先做出下一代模型","bold":true},{"text":"。"}],"id":"L-YGPVhi4X"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"不是谁的PPT更好看，不是谁的融资更多。"}],"id":"T_Ql1aCXo2"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"AI不是魔法，是重工业。它需要天文数字的电费，需要信誉，需要冷酷的财务纪律。"}],"id":"Ar6_Tei4FH"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Anthropic的9000亿估值，本质上是市场在押注：下一个「iPhone时刻」，可能不在OpenAI手里。"}],"id":"7HvWdzm6fo"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"参考资料： "}],"id":"11hI_DNq-_"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"https://futurism.com/artificial-intelligence/downloads-chatgpt-slowing-worst-time-openai "}],"id":"OFuk-WkJ4u"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-04-29/anthropic-considering-funding-offers-at-over-900-billion-value?srnd=phx-technology "}],"id":"KkoHtvapNK"},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"https://www.ft.com/content/664a57e2-dffa-401e-81ad-55129ffb0e89?syn-25a6b1a6=1 "}],"id":"iRXjSOQZcV"}]